2,The Unheard Voices of Wakhi Community - The Reporters,https://thereporters.pk/the-unheard-voices-of-wakhi-community/,"September 23, 2022 - The Wakhi people are not only rich in their language and culture, but also their folk music serves as a “soul soothing” experience in the wild terrains. Rubab, Dadang, Qufuz and Surnai profoundly impact their traditional music and folklore.",Wakhi,Indo-European
